1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,304
现在我们的原型没有后端
Right now our prototype has no backend.

2
00:00:02,624 --> 00:00:06,912
用户做的一切都只存在那一个浏览器里、那一台设备上
Everything a user does is saved in that one browser, on that one device,

3
00:00:06,912 --> 00:00:09,771
页面上的诊所和价格也都是编的
and the clinics and prices it shows are made up.

4
00:00:10,091 --> 00:00:15,176
所以，在国内的家长看不到孩子在波士顿存的保险卡
So a parent in China cannot see the insurance card their child added in Boston:

5
00:00:15,176 --> 00:00:17,365
根本没有地方可以去取
there is nowhere to fetch it from.

6
00:00:17,685 --> 00:00:22,357
账号、家庭关联和保险卡，都需要一个共同的地方来存
Accounts, family links and insurance cards all need one shared place to live.

7
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:27,521
周五傍晚，一个 agent 写了一份 223 行的决策记录
Late on Friday afternoon an agent wrote a 223-line decision record

8
00:00:27,521 --> 00:00:29,121
提议把它们放在哪里
proposing where.

9
00:00:29,341 --> 00:00:32,563
这一集讲它是怎么选的，以及它保护了什么
This episode is about how it chose, and what it protects.

10
00:00:33,900 --> 00:00:35,607
后端有几项工作
A backend has a few jobs.

11
00:00:35,927 --> 00:00:41,367
服务器接收每一个请求，并检查规则：谁在问，有没有权限
A server receives every request and checks the rules: who is asking, and are they allowed.

12
00:00:41,687 --> 00:00:43,287
数据库负责记住
A database remembers.

13
00:00:43,564 --> 00:00:45,463
登录这一步证明你是谁
A login step proves who you are.

14
00:00:45,783 --> 00:00:49,269
团队在周一的会上定了一条硬性要求
And because the team set one hard rule at Monday's meeting,

15
00:00:49,269 --> 00:00:52,222
产品必须在 Mac 和 Windows 上都能跑
that the product must run on both Mac and Windows,

16
00:00:52,222 --> 00:00:55,767
所以一切都装进容器，一条命令就能启动
everything goes into containers that start with one command.

17
00:00:56,087 --> 00:00:57,900
决策记录给每个位置都填上了
The record fills each slot:

18
00:00:57,900 --> 00:01:00,520
服务器用 Hono，一个小巧的服务器框架
Hono, a small framework for the server,

19
00:01:00,520 --> 00:01:03,542
再用 Zod 检查每个请求的格式
with Zod to check the shape of every request;

20
00:01:03,542 --> 00:01:05,289
数据库用 Postgres
Postgres for the database;

21
00:01:05,289 --> 00:01:08,043
登录用 Better Auth 加邮箱验证码
Better Auth with emailed codes for login;

22
00:01:08,043 --> 00:01:11,468
最后用 Docker Compose 把三个盒子一起跑起来
and Docker Compose to run the three boxes together.

23
00:01:12,817 --> 00:01:14,673
第一个问题是语言
The first question was language.

24
00:01:14,917 --> 00:01:16,275
你看得懂 Python
You read Python.

25
00:01:16,325 --> 00:01:18,138
为什么后端不用 Python？
Why isn't the backend in Python?

26
00:01:21,817 --> 00:01:24,238
因为浏览器只能运行 JavaScript
Because browsers only run JavaScript,

27
00:01:24,238 --> 00:01:26,725
而我们的页面是用 TypeScript 写的
and our page is written in TypeScript,

28
00:01:26,725 --> 00:01:29,540
TypeScript 就是加了类型检查的 JavaScript
which is JavaScript with type checks added.

29
00:01:29,860 --> 00:01:31,451
决策记录把它写成一条规则
The record makes it a rule:

30
00:01:31,451 --> 00:01:35,342
前端是固定的约束，应该是后端适配前端
the front end is a fixed constraint, so the back end adapts to it.

31
00:01:35,662 --> 00:01:40,380
分诊和保险这两个原型，都已经用 TypeScript 写好了
Both prototypes, triage and insurance, are already written in TypeScript,

32
00:01:40,380 --> 00:01:42,190
在它们还没合并的 PR 里
in their open pull requests.

33
00:01:42,510 --> 00:01:48,291
用同一种语言，服务器和页面就共用同一份数据描述
With one language, the server and the page share a single description of every piece of data;

34
00:01:48,291 --> 00:01:53,326
在服务器上改一个字段名，页面在任何人运行之前就会检查失败
rename a field on the server, and the page fails its check before anyone runs it.

35
00:01:53,567 --> 00:01:58,020
Python 的主要优势是它做 AI 检索的库
Python's main advantage would be its libraries for AI retrieval,

36
00:01:58,020 --> 00:02:04,631
但分诊的提议是在核对过的事实卡里查价格、电话和营业时间
but the triage proposal looks up prices, phone numbers and opening hours in checked fact cards,

37
00:02:04,631 --> 00:02:06,580
而不是用 AI 相似度检索
not by AI similarity search.

38
00:02:06,900 --> 00:02:08,469
所以 Python 留作一条后路
So Python stays an exit:

39
00:02:08,469 --> 00:02:11,871
以后做成一个独立的服务，由 TypeScript 后端来调用
a separate service later, behind the TypeScript one.

40
00:02:12,191 --> 00:02:15,450
Express 落选是因为没有内建的请求检查
Express lost for having no built-in request checks,

41
00:02:15,450 --> 00:02:18,390
NestJS 是因为对三个人来说规矩太多
NestJS for too much ceremony for three people,

42
00:02:18,390 --> 00:02:20,499
而 Supabase 这类托管后端
and hosted backends like Supabase

43
00:02:20,499 --> 00:02:27,146
是因为用户和健康数据会放在第三方那里，而团队还没定下隐私规则
because user and health data would sit with a third party before the team has settled its privacy rules.

44
00:02:27,466 --> 00:02:32,010
Fastify 一样合适；记录说它是同等的备选
Fastify was just as good; the record calls it an equal alternative.

45
00:02:33,350 --> 00:02:35,099
数据库选的是 Postgres
For the database, Postgres.

46
00:02:35,419 --> 00:02:36,919
这些数据的核心是关联
The data is about links:

47
00:02:36,919 --> 00:02:41,435
家长关联到学生，每一次权限检查都要顺着这条关联走
a parent is linked to a student, and every permission check follows that link.

48
00:02:41,755 --> 00:02:44,432
MongoDB 正是因为这一点落选的
MongoDB lost for exactly that reason,

49
00:02:44,432 --> 00:02:49,713
SQLite 则是因为单个文件不适合以后很多人同时在线
and SQLite because a single file doesn't suit many people online at once.

50
00:02:49,950 --> 00:02:54,848
有一列是故意做得灵活的：一个保险字段存的不只是值
One column is flexible on purpose: an insurance field stores not just a value

51
00:02:54,848 --> 00:03:00,510
还有扫描保险卡时有多确定、它从哪来，以及读出它的原文
but how sure the card scanner was, where it came from, and the raw text it was read from.

52
00:03:00,830 --> 00:03:05,457
我们装的数据库还自带一个按语义搜索的扩展
The database we install also comes with an add-on for searching by meaning,

53
00:03:05,457 --> 00:03:07,123
但现在没有任何地方需要它
but nothing needs it today.

54
00:03:07,443 --> 00:03:09,470
它是一扇开着的门，不是一个计划
It is an open door, not a plan.

55
00:03:09,790 --> 00:03:13,508
表结构的改动用带编号的迁移文件同步
Changes to the tables travel as numbered migration files,

56
00:03:13,508 --> 00:03:16,574
所以每一份数据库最后都一样
so every copy of the database ends up the same.

57
00:03:17,917 --> 00:03:20,050
登录完全不用密码
Login uses no passwords at all.

58
00:03:20,370 --> 00:03:26,043
你输入邮箱，收到一个 6 位验证码，5 分钟内有效，可以试 3 次
You type your email and receive a six-digit code, valid for five minutes, with three tries,

59
00:03:26,043 --> 00:03:30,469
记录要求服务器只保存它打乱后的哈希
and the record requires the server to keep only a scrambled hash of it,

60
00:03:30,469 --> 00:03:33,399
这样验证码不会以明文存着
so the codes are never stored as readable text,

61
00:03:33,399 --> 00:03:38,013
还要加上自己的限流：每个邮箱每分钟一个，每小时最多五个
plus its own limit of one code a minute per address, at most five an hour.

62
00:03:38,333 --> 00:03:42,024
PR 里写着，你周五确认了只用邮箱登录
The pull request notes you confirmed email-only on Friday.

63
00:03:42,344 --> 00:03:46,371
记录给的理由是：每个中国家长都有邮箱
The record's reasons: every Chinese parent has an email address,

64
00:03:46,371 --> 00:03:48,637
而且没有密码可忘
and nobody has a password to forget.

65
00:03:48,884 --> 00:03:54,533
给国内手机号发短信要花钱，微信登录需要注册公司
Text messages to Chinese numbers cost money, WeChat login needs a registered company,

66
00:03:54,533 --> 00:03:59,252
托管登录服务把用户数据放在别处，还按用户数收费
and hosted login services keep user data elsewhere and charge per user.

67
00:03:59,572 --> 00:04:02,665
自己从零写，正是安全漏洞的来源
Writing it from scratch is how security holes happen.

68
00:04:02,985 --> 00:04:06,875
选中的 Better Auth 跑在我们自己的服务器里
The library chosen, Better Auth, runs inside our own server,

69
00:04:06,875 --> 00:04:09,534
数据都存进我们自己的 Postgres
and keeps everything in our own Postgres.

70
00:04:10,883 --> 00:04:14,040
接下来是数据的结构，也就是保护人的那一部分
Then the shape of the data, the part that protects people.

71
00:04:14,360 --> 00:04:17,774
每个账号都有一个身份，学生或家长，只写一次
Every account has a role, student or parent, written once.

72
00:04:18,094 --> 00:04:20,941
在这第一版里，用户自己不能改
In this first version, the user can't change it;

73
00:04:20,941 --> 00:04:25,091
记录写道，否则学生能把自己改成家长
otherwise, the record notes, a student could make themselves a parent.

74
00:04:25,333 --> 00:04:29,130
谁应该能发起家庭关联：学生，还是家长？
Who should be able to start a family link: the student, or the parent?

75
00:04:31,833 --> 00:04:34,249
只有学生能发起家庭关联
Only the student can start a family link,

76
00:04:34,249 --> 00:04:37,785
因为学生是病人，健康数据归学生所有
because the student is the patient and owns the health data.

77
00:04:38,105 --> 00:04:39,839
学生生成一个邀请码
They create an invite code:

78
00:04:39,839 --> 00:04:44,206
至少 8 个字符，72 小时内有效，只能用一次
at least eight characters, valid for seventy-two hours, usable once.

79
00:04:44,526 --> 00:04:49,917
关联之后，家长只能看到学生的资料和当前的保险卡，而且只读
Once linked, a parent sees the student's profile and current insurance card, read-only,

80
00:04:49,917 --> 00:04:51,417
其他什么都看不到
and nothing else;

81
00:04:51,417 --> 00:04:56,452
以后新增的内容，比如分诊对话，默认不对家长开放
anything added later, such as triage chats, is closed to parents by default.

82
00:04:56,772 --> 00:04:59,001
目前不存保险卡照片
For now, card photos are not stored;

83
00:04:59,001 --> 00:05:03,086
保险卡在设备上识别，只保留文字字段
the card is read on the device, and only the text fields are kept.

84
00:05:04,433 --> 00:05:08,677
初稿由四个审查者从不同角度读过
The first draft was read by four reviewers from different angles:

85
00:05:08,677 --> 00:05:13,573
外部事实、和仓库是否一致、隐私和数据结构
outside facts, consistency with the repository, privacy and the data model,

86
00:05:13,573 --> 00:05:15,270
以及 issue 的验收清单
and the issue's checklist.

87
00:05:15,590 --> 00:05:19,388
他们一共提了 31 条意见，一个裁判 agent 保留了 14 条
They raised thirty-one comments, and a judge agent kept fourteen.

88
00:05:19,708 --> 00:05:23,834
第二版修正了不少问题，其中有三个真错误
The second version fixed, among other things, three real mistakes:

89
00:05:23,834 --> 00:05:28,086
它给保险字段自己起了状态和来源的名称
it had made up its own status and source labels for insurance fields

90
00:05:28,086 --> 00:05:30,461
而不是先读保险的代码
instead of reading the insurance code,

91
00:05:30,461 --> 00:05:32,399
让关联的家长录入保险卡
let linked parents enter cards,

92
00:05:32,399 --> 00:05:35,900
还打算复用带着模拟数据的服务
and planned to reuse services that carry fictional data.

93
00:05:36,150 --> 00:05:39,691
但修订本身也带进了一个错误，被 Bugbot 抓到了
But the revision added a mistake of its own, and Bugbot caught it.

94
00:05:40,011 --> 00:05:43,963
解除关联时只记下了时间，关联还标着有效
Unlinking only recorded the time and left the link marked active,

95
00:05:43,963 --> 00:05:46,091
家长就会一直保留访问权限
so a parent would have kept access.

96
00:05:46,411 --> 00:05:50,038
只差一个词，还是在一份书面计划里，代码都还没写
One missing word, in a written plan, before any code existed.

97
00:05:50,358 --> 00:05:53,344
修正在那条评论之后 21 秒就提交了
The fix landed twenty-one seconds after the comment.

98
00:05:53,583 --> 00:05:56,292
如果没有 bot 盯着，什么能抓住它？
If no bot had been watching, what would have caught it?

99
00:06:02,083 --> 00:06:05,222
一个测试就能，而且记录里已经要求了
A test would, and the record already asks for one:

100
00:06:05,222 --> 00:06:10,872
学生解除关联后，家长的下一个请求必须被拒绝，并且自动检查
after a student unlinks, the parent's next request must be refused, checked automatically.

101
00:06:11,192 --> 00:06:13,684
这份决策本身还是提议
The decision itself is still a proposal;

102
00:06:13,684 --> 00:06:18,915
issue 要求你们三个人线下确认之后，才能改为已采纳
the issue asks the three of you to confirm it in person before it is marked adopted.

103
00:06:19,150 --> 00:06:22,993
还没定的：国内能不能访问到服务器
Still open: whether the servers can be reached from China,

104
00:06:22,993 --> 00:06:27,432
用哪个发信服务才不会进 QQ 和 163 的垃圾箱
which email service stays out of QQ and one-six-three spam folders,

105
00:06:27,432 --> 00:06:32,334
家长能不能录入保险卡信息，以及删除的数据要保留多久
whether parents may enter card details, and how long deleted data lingers.

106
00:06:32,654 --> 00:06:35,773
这份技术文档里有两个产品决定
Two product calls sit in this technical document,

107
00:06:35,773 --> 00:06:38,510
在那几个 issue 定下来之前都只是暂定
both provisional until those issues decide:

108
00:06:38,510 --> 00:06:44,110
家长默认看不到任何新内容，删除学生账号会连同保险卡一起删除
parents see nothing new by default, and deleting a student's account deletes their card.

109
00:06:44,430 --> 00:06:48,718
还有一处要整理的：两个不同的决策，编号都是 0006
And one piece of housekeeping: two different decisions are both numbered six.

110
00:06:51,267 --> 00:06:54,139
所以：用 TypeScript，因为页面说了算
So: TypeScript, because the page decides;

111
00:06:54,139 --> 00:06:56,661
用 Postgres，因为数据的核心是关联
Postgres, because the data is links;

112
00:06:56,661 --> 00:06:59,884
用邮箱验证码，因为每个家长都有邮箱
emailed codes, because every parent has email;

113
00:06:59,884 --> 00:07:03,107
用容器，因为它必须在任何电脑上都能跑
containers, because it must run on any laptop.

114
00:07:03,427 --> 00:07:06,499
还有一个数据结构，它真正的工作是保护隐私
And a data model whose real job is privacy.

115
00:07:06,734 --> 00:07:08,113
三个问题
Three questions.

116
00:07:08,163 --> 00:07:09,977
为什么后端不用 Python？
Why isn't the backend in Python?

117
00:07:10,297 --> 00:07:12,878
是什么阻止学生把自己改成家长？
What stops a student from making themselves a parent?

118
00:07:13,198 --> 00:07:15,779
没有 bot 的话，什么能抓住解除关联的那个 bug？
And what would have caught the unlink bug without a bot?

119
00:07:21,017 --> 00:07:22,617
这一周的内容到这里结束
That ends this week's batch.

120
00:07:22,937 --> 00:07:26,372
下周的几集，从下周的 PR 开始
Next week's episodes start from next week's pull requests.
